\newlabel{app:noise:robustness_grid_qm9_grouped_wider}{{S.1}{29}{\textbf {Robustness of every base model on every representation under grouped-wider noise, on the QM9 HOMO--LUMO gap.} Rows are the 13 base models, ordered by family, and columns the six representations. One cell is one model on one representation, the median \aucnorm {} over 10 replicates, with its value printed on it. Color runs on the same fixed range as Figure~\ref {fig:grid}, which shows Gaussian and grouped-shifted noise}{figure.caption.1}{}}
